---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Disclaimer" lang="en">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-8 md:py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-near-black mb-4">📋 Disclaimer</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-sm text-gray-600 space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-near-black">Restaurant Data</h3>
      <p>Restaurant data is sourced from the public FEHD list. We do our best to keep it accurate, but we cannot guarantee it is free of errors. Please confirm the pet policy with the restaurant directly before visiting.</p>

      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-near-black">Health Information</h3>
      <p>All health articles are for reference only and do not constitute medical advice. For any health concerns, please consult a registered veterinarian.</p>

      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-near-black">Copyright</h3>
      <p>Health articles are adapted from Korea Companion Animal Education Association (KCAEA HK) course notes, rewritten and supplemented with original content. Reproduction or redistribution without permission is prohibited.</p>

      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-near-black">External Links</h3>
      <p>This site may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content of those external sites.</p>

      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-8">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>